{%- # CUSTOM: net-new snippet — renders one vertical CSS-only bar column (value label + track/fill) for the MO Clinical & Science GLP chart. X-axis label is rendered separately by the parent section in its own flex row so it stays in normal document flow beneath the absolutely-positioned chart area. UPSTREAM risk LOW — no Horizon file touched. -%}
{%- # Params: block (a section.blocks entry of type 'bar') -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bs = block.settings
  assign v = bs.value | default: 0
-%}
{%- # CUSTOM: --v is set once on the shared bar-col parent (not on track/fill individually) so the value label, track, and fill all inherit the same number via normal CSS custom-property inheritance — setting it only on a sibling silently fails since inheritance only flows parent-to-child. -%}
<div class="mo-science__bar-col" style="--v: {{ v }};" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- comment -%}
    CUSTOM FIX (2026-07-17, audit #22 follow-up): was class "mo-tag", which
    forces IBM Plex Mono + uppercase + 14px — Figma shows this value as plain
    Manrope Bold 16px, not a mono tag. Typography now lives directly on
    .mo-science__bar-value in custom.css instead of a shared utility class.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <span class="mo-science__bar-value">{{ v }}%</span>
  <span class="mo-science__bar-track">
    <span class="mo-science__bar-fill"></span>
  </span>
</div>
